      "source": "prose",
      "promptMarkdown": "Write test cases for the user story below.\n\nStory SHIP-9: Shipping fee at checkout\n\nAs a shopper, I want to see the right shipping fee at checkout, so that I know what I will pay.\n\n- AC-1: Standard shipping is free when the order subtotal is $50.00 or more; otherwise it costs $5.99.\n- AC-2: Members get free standard shipping at any subtotal.\n- AC-3: Express shipping costs $12.99, except for members, who pay $7.99 for express at any subtotal.\n\nWhere information is missing, state your assumption and continue; do not ask questions. Reply with the deliverable only, as Markdown, starting at its first line, with no introduction and no code fence around it. Do not create or edit files.",
